{"id":"0b49bb7a-052c-5fe7-a05f-f647bb862a91","title":"快速上手","icon":"🚀","cover":"none","parentId":null,"favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-08T19:30:30.196Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:40:29.959Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"快速上手","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"快速上手 · 无需终端","title":"可进化的人机交互界面","lead":"Agent 的回答不再只是一段文字，而是一个可以交互、可以归档、在使用中不断进化的界面。","facts":[{"label":"电脑","value":"Apple Silicon Mac · macOS 13+"},{"label":"Agent","value":"Claude Code 或 Codex"},{"label":"安装","value":"DMG，无需 Node.js"}],"actions":[{"label":"下载 ShowAI","href":"https://github.com/Renaissance-Mind/ShowAI/releases/latest","primary":true},{"label":"连接 Agent 时的常见问题","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-troubleshooting"}],"art":"start"},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-e5c78756"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ShowAI 在你已经在用的 Agent 里工作：装上插件后，Agent 就能把回答做成界面；ShowAI App 负责保存、打开和继续编辑这些界面。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e6c788e9"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"本页从下载开始，带你做出第一个界面，再继续修改和分享它。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e3c78430"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-e4c785c3"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"开始前"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"需要：Apple Silicon Mac（macOS 13 或更高版本），以及已登录的 Claude Code 或 Codex（也可以在 App 中填写模型 API Key）。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e9c78da2"}},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agent 的命令行工具要能运行。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" ShowAI 通过 Agent 自己的插件命令安装插件。在终端运行 "},{"type":"text","text":"claude --version","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 或 "},{"type":"text","text":"codex --version","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 能看到版本号即可；Codex 也可以使用 Codex App 自带的命令行工具，ShowAI 会自动查找。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2f294c6d"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-503ffc7a"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"还没有 Agent？","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 在 App 中填写模型 API Key，使用内置 Agent，见本页「不使用 Claude Code 或 Codex」。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a9fbb82"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-513ffe0d"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"使用 Windows 或 Linux？","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 从源码运行浏览器版，见 "},{"type":"text","text":"安装与运行","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/install"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ba17d843"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4e3ff954"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-eac78f35"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-e7c78a7c"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"1. 安装 ShowAI"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"下载 DMG","body":"从 GitHub 的[最新发行版](https://github.com/Renaissance-Mind/ShowAI/releases/latest)下载 DMG。"},{"title":"拖进「应用程序」，然后打开","body":"打开 DMG，把 **ShowAI** 拖进「应用程序」，再从「应用程序」打开 ShowAI。","result":"首次启动时，ShowAI 显示欢迎页。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-e8c78c0f"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"🛡️","tone":"sand","id":"node-edc793ee"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"macOS 阻止首次打开？","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 当前版本尚未经过 Apple 公证，macOS 可能阻止首次打开。遇到时打开「系统设置 → 隐私与安全性」，选择「仍要打开」（参见 "},{"type":"text","text":"Apple 的说明","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://support.apple.com/zh-cn/102445"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"）。每个版本的发行说明会写明是否仍需这一步。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-80c7ad59"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-eec79581"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"2. 连接你的 Agent"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"打开插件面板","body":"首次启动时，欢迎页会显示插件面板；之后随时可以在「设置 → 插件」中找到。"},{"title":"安装插件","body":"ShowAI 会检测 Claude Code 与 Codex。在你使用的 Agent 旁点「安装插件」。","result":"插件显示「已安装并启用」。"},{"title":"重新加载 Agent","body":"Claude Code 重启会话；Codex 刷新插件或重启 Codex。"},{"title":"新开一个对话","body":"已经打开的对话仍使用旧的工具列表，请在新对话里继续下一步。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-251c6d9b"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"要确认连接，「设置 → 插件」会给出测试提示词「用 ShowAI 列出我的项目」。在新对话中发送它；Agent 连上 ShowAI 后，该 Agent 旁的状态会从「等待第一次调用」变为「已收到第一次调用」。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-241c6c08"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"插件和它连接的运行时都由 App 提供，不需要源码，也不需要另外安装 Node.js。插件连接 App 当前的内容库；切换内容库或移动 App 后，点「更新并启用」。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-271c70c1"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"面板提示未找到 Agent、显示「已安装，尚未启用」或提示其他来源的插件时，见 "},{"type":"text","text":"连接 Agent 时的常见问题","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-troubleshooting"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-261c6f2e"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-291c73e7"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"3. 让 Agent 做第一个界面"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在新对话中粘贴："}],"attrs":{"id":"node-281c7254"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"💬","tone":"sage","id":"node-2b1c770d"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"用 ShowAI 帮我做一个房贷计算器：房价、首付比例、利率和贷款年限可以调整，显示月供和总利息。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-69b75c82"}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agent 会直接在对话里显示这个计算器，你可以马上调整数值试用。这一步只是展示，还没有保存。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2a1c757a"}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"quick-save-lead"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"想留下来继续改，接着说："}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"💬","tone":"sage","id":"quick-save-callout"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"quick-save-prompt"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"存到 ShowAI。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"quick-save-result"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agent 会用同一份数据把它保存为 ShowAI 中的一个页面并展示出来：支持内嵌显示的 Agent 直接在对话里显示，其他 Agent 给出可以打开的 HTML 文件。在 App 中，它出现在「最近」里。一开始就想保存，也可以在请求里直接说“……并保存到 ShowAI”。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"再试两个："}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1d1c6103"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"💬","tone":"sage","id":"node-1c1c5f70"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"用 ShowAI 比较两台折叠屏手机：按便携、续航、影像和价格列出差异，并让我调整各项权重。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-15d4af87"}}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"💬","tone":"sage","id":"node-9314cc00"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"用 ShowAI 一步步讲清注意力机制，配一个可以调整参数、观察权重变化的示意。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9f33d9b7"}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agent 只用文字回答，或说找不到 ShowAI？对话可能在插件加载前就已开始，见 "},{"type":"text","text":"连接 Agent 时的常见问题","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-troubleshooting"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9414cd93"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-9514cf26"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"4. 继续修改"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"node-9614d0b9"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"保存后的界面是属于你的页面。从「最近」打开它就可以直接编辑：输入文字，或输入 "},{"type":"text","text":"/","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 插入表格、图表、图片等组件。保存状态显示「本机已保存」时，修改已经存储。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"然后让 Agent 接着做："}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9714d24c"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"💬","tone":"sage","id":"node-9814d3df"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"加一张按年份显示剩余本金的图表。保留我改过的数值。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a56b66a0"}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agent 修改前会先读取当前页面，包括你的修改。逐步点「下一步」，看一次创建和一次续改中发生了什么。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9914d572"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-sequence","version":"1.0.0","props":{"title":"一次创建，一次续改","actors":[{"id":"you","label":"你","icon":"🙂","tone":"brand"},{"id":"agent","label":"Agent","sub":"Claude Code / Codex","icon":"🤖","tone":"teal"},{"id":"plugin","label":"ShowAI 插件","sub":"工具","tone":"teal"},{"id":"app","label":"ShowAI App","sub":"你的页面","icon":"🗂️","tone":"slate"}],"steps":[{"from":"you","to":"agent","label":"粘贴房贷计算器提示词","kind":"call","detail":"说清要做什么。想放进某个项目时，在提示词里写上项目名。"},{"from":"agent","to":"plugin","label":"做出界面并保存","kind":"call","detail":"Agent 选用滑块、图表等组件做出界面，先保存为项目里的一个页面。没有指定项目时，按 Agent 当前的工作目录确定项目。"},{"from":"plugin","to":"agent","label":"返回可以展示的页面","kind":"reply","detail":"支持内嵌显示的 Agent 直接在对话里显示；其他 Agent 给出可以打开的 HTML 文件。"},{"from":"plugin","to":"app","label":"页面出现在「最近」","kind":"note","detail":"插件和 App 使用同一个内容库，App 中可以直接打开这个页面。"},{"from":"you","to":"app","label":"改几个数值","kind":"call","detail":"你的修改自动保存，状态显示「本机已保存」。"},{"from":"you","to":"agent","label":"“加一张剩余本金的图表”","kind":"call","detail":"让 Agent 在你的修改上继续。"},{"from":"agent","to":"plugin","label":"先读取当前页面，再保存","kind":"call","detail":"Agent 读到的是包含你修改的最新版本，保存时带上读取时的版本号。"},{"from":"plugin","to":"agent","label":"页面又被改过时暂停保存","kind":"reply","detail":"你和 Agent 同时修改同一页面时，后保存的一方会被暂停，两份内容都保留下来供比较，**不会互相覆盖**。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-54ea7e21b2eb7835fb0ba41ca4d48f1ab21bc27b88b7f8fa2b03d3b910b05e76"},"id":"node-9a14d705"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现有组件表达不了需要的内容时，Agent 可以为它写一个新组件；好用的页面可以沉淀为模板，作为下一次的起点。详见 "},{"type":"text","text":"组件与模板","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/components"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9b14d898"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-9c14da2b"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"5. 分享"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"交付方式"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f8c3afce"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d36bcea1"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"用途"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fe3a90f9"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d26bcd0e"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-19b71e46"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"独立 HTML"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c24882b1"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2e43a376"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"发送单页、离线阅读或归档"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9dbef1c6"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2f43a509"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1ab71fd9"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"inline 片段"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-be226008"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7d1d5857"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在支持 HTML 展示的 Agent 对话中预览整页或选定部分"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-434a58d3"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7c1d56c4"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-17b71b20"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"静态网站"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-70898ab"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d7f52d2c"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"把多页内容组织成带导航的网站"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-61e06d80"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d8f52ebf"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-18b71cb3"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ShowAI JSON"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e54d8e5a"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ff1a6f15"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"重新导入并继续编辑"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6a758725"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fe1a6d82"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1db72492"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1917dd89"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在页面菜单中选择「导出页面」，或让 Agent 导出。独立 HTML 无需安装 ShowAI 就能在浏览器中打开，图表、折叠区域和本地计算等交互仍然可用。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1817dbf6"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"外部链接需要网络；需要完全离线阅读时，把图片内嵌到页面。HTML 导出会同时保存 "},{"type":"text","text":".showai.json","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 源文件，便于以后导入继续编辑。各格式的差别见 "},{"type":"text","text":"导出与分享","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/export"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1717da63"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-1617d8d0"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"不使用 Claude Code 或 Codex"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":3,"cards":[{"icon":"🤖","title":"内置 Agent","tag":"正式","tone":"brand","body":"打开「设置 → Agent」，添加使用 API Key 的模型来源（也可以使用本机 Codex 或 Claude Code 的登录，或 ShowAI Cloud）。然后点顶栏的 AI 按钮，或选中文字、打开内容块菜单，选择「让 AI 处理」。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/built-in-agent"},{"icon":"🔌","title":"其他 Agent","tag":"预览 · 邀请制 · 实验","tone":"teal","body":"DeepSeek Harness 与 Kimi 处于预览阶段，网页版 ChatGPT 采用邀请制，Gemini CLI、OpenCode 等其他 MCP 客户端可以手动配置。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-hosts"},{"icon":"✍️","title":"单独使用工作台","tag":"手动建页","tone":"violet","body":"不连接 Agent 也能使用：点「新建项目」，添加按阅读顺序排版的 Page 或可以自由摆放内容的 Board，输入 `/` 插入组件。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/page-board"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-1d17e3d5"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-1c17e242"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"接下来"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":3,"cards":[{"icon":"🧩","title":"手动建页：Page 与 Board","body":"不经过 Agent，自己新建项目和页面，插入组件，在白板上摆放内容。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/page-board"},{"icon":"🤝","title":"在 Agent 中使用","body":"支持的 Agent、插件安装、内容库与项目，以及 Agent 怎样处理页面。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-hosts"},{"icon":"🧭","title":"核心概念","body":"内容库、项目、页面、白板、组件和模板如何关联。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/concepts"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5